**Azure Policy assignment (Deny effect, pinned definition version):**

```json
{
  "properties": {
    "displayName": "Deny storage accounts without customer-managed key encryption",
    "policyDefinitionId": "/providers/Microsoft.Authorization/policyDefinitions/<built-in-cmk-definition-id>",
    "definitionVersion": "1.0.0",
    "enforcementMode": "Default",
    "parameters": {
      "effect": { "value": "Deny" }
    }
  },
  "scope": "/subscriptions/<sub-id>/resourceGroups/rg-analytics-prod"
}
```

**Companion AWS service control policy, attached to the analytics OU:**

```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Sid": "DenyUnencryptedObjectUploads",
      "Effect": "Deny",
      "Action": "s3:PutObject",
      "Resource": "*",
      "Condition": {
        "StringNotEquals": {
          "s3:x-amz-server-side-encryption": "aws:kms"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

**Control-map entry for this change (the Lesson 24 artifact, filled in for this one row):**

| Governance area | Azure control | AWS control | Translation mechanism | Owner |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Encryption-at-rest | Azure Policy, Deny, pinned v1.0.0 | SCP `DenyUnencryptedObjectUploads`, attached to the Analytics OU | Written and attached in the same change ticket (CHG-2026-0417) | Cloud Security team |
